WEBVTT

00:00:03.685 --> 00:00:04.519
Huh?

00:00:04.603 --> 00:00:06.187
(ice crackling)

00:00:06.271 --> 00:00:07.272
(gasping)

00:00:08.231 --> 00:00:09.065
(yells)

00:00:09.858 --> 00:00:11.401
Ow!

00:00:12.110 --> 00:00:13.111
(grunts)
别像藤壶一样站在那儿

00:00:13.445 --> 00:00:16.031
Don't stand there
like barnacles. Get him!
别像藤壶一样站在那儿

00:00:16.114 --> 00:00:17.449
CREW:
Arr!

00:00:18.325 --> 00:00:19.951
Oi, going
somewhere, mate?
嘿 去哪儿 伙计

00:00:20.785 --> 00:00:22.495
(Tarzan yell)

00:00:22.579 --> 00:00:23.413
(grunts)

00:00:23.496 --> 00:00:24.873
-(chuckles)
-Whoa!

00:00:26.041 --> 00:00:26.875
Let me at 'em!
让我揍他

00:00:26.958 --> 00:00:27.834
(screams)
让我揍他

00:00:28.752 --> 00:00:29.586
Whoa!

00:00:31.129 --> 00:00:31.963
(chuckles)

00:00:32.047 --> 00:00:33.590
Any last words?
有什么遗言吗

00:00:34.341 --> 00:00:36.259
Precious!
宝宝

00:00:36.343 --> 00:00:38.219
Will you stop
with the "Precious"?
能不能不要再提宝宝了

00:00:39.429 --> 00:00:40.305
(both gasp)

00:00:40.639 --> 00:00:41.640
(shuddering)

00:00:41.723 --> 00:00:42.557
Mummy.
我的妈呀

00:00:42.641 --> 00:00:44.684
(screaming)
我的妈呀

00:00:45.268 --> 00:00:47.937
Well, I-I guess
we showed them, huh?
看来他们知难而退了

00:00:48.313 --> 00:00:49.147
Precious!
宝宝

00:00:49.230 --> 00:00:50.523
That's your pet?!
这是你的宠物

00:00:52.192 --> 00:00:54.235
(bellowing)

00:00:54.319 --> 00:00:56.613
Maybe that crazy old bat
isn't that crazy after all.
也许他们说的疯婆子其实一点也不疯

00:00:56.696 --> 00:00:57.530
Ooh!

00:00:57.614 --> 00:00:59.616
-(screams)
-(laughs)

00:00:59.699 --> 00:01:00.867
Nope, she's nuts.
好吧 还是疯子

00:01:00.950 --> 00:01:04.287
You waiting for a formal
invitation, fancy pants?
你是在等我发邀请信吗 臭小子

00:01:04.371 --> 00:01:05.205
GRANNY: Get in.
快进来

00:01:05.288 --> 00:01:07.123
Ah, I'm gonna regret this.
啊 我肯定会后悔的

00:01:07.207 --> 00:01:08.333
(gasps)
啊 我肯定会后悔的

00:01:09.668 --> 00:01:11.211
Bombs away!
炸弹出击

00:01:11.294 --> 00:01:12.962
-(yells)
-Ow!

00:01:13.421 --> 00:01:14.255
(grunts)

00:01:14.339 --> 00:01:15.173
(screams)

00:01:16.591 --> 00:01:17.467
(laughs)

00:01:17.550 --> 00:01:19.302
Don't be a scaredy cat.
别跟我躲猫猫了

00:01:21.554 --> 00:01:22.889
(Sid screaming)

00:01:25.517 --> 00:01:26.434
(grunts)

00:01:26.518 --> 00:01:27.352
Ugh.

00:01:27.435 --> 00:01:29.062
This smells worse than me.
这比我还难闻呢

00:01:29.145 --> 00:01:32.482
Precious, set your flippers
45 degrees north.
宝宝 设定尾鳍方向偏北45度

00:01:32.565 --> 00:01:34.359
Granny's done running.
奶奶开始反击了

00:01:34.442 --> 00:01:35.985
-Back off!
-It's okay.
别过来

00:01:36.069 --> 00:01:37.696
I'm on your side.
(gasps)
没事的 我是自己人

00:01:38.446 --> 00:01:40.448
I knew you were a traitor!
我就知道你是叛徒

00:01:40.782 --> 00:01:42.325
Oh, your little
bunny nose wiggles
你生气的时候小鼻子一抖一抖

00:01:42.409 --> 00:01:44.494
in the cutest way
when you're mad.
这样子真是太可爱了

00:01:44.577 --> 00:01:45.453
What?!
什么

00:01:45.870 --> 00:01:47.831
Your nine lives
are over, kitty!
你的九条命都完了 臭猫

00:01:48.248 --> 00:01:50.834
Silly rabbit,
piracy doesn't pay.
当海盗没出息

00:01:51.167 --> 00:01:52.043
Hey, that's not cool.
嘿 你这样很不好 快帮帮我

00:01:52.127 --> 00:01:53.002
Come on now.
嘿 你这样很不好 快帮帮我

00:01:55.422 --> 00:01:56.339
(growls)

00:01:59.300 --> 00:02:01.386
Ugh. Anyone have a body wipe?
给我条浴巾擦擦

00:02:01.469 --> 00:02:02.887
Suck it up, buttercup!
少废话 娘娘腔

00:02:03.388 --> 00:02:04.305
How's it looking?
情况怎么样

00:02:05.265 --> 00:02:06.099
(gasps)

00:02:07.016 --> 00:02:08.476
SID: Not good, Granny, sir.
情况不妙 奶奶长官

00:02:08.560 --> 00:02:09.394
SID: Ow!

00:02:09.477 --> 00:02:10.478
Full speed ahead!
全速前进 下潜 下潜 下潜

00:02:11.020 --> 00:02:12.397
Dive, dive, dive!
全速前进 下潜 下潜 下潜

00:02:13.773 --> 00:02:14.607
(growling)

00:02:15.483 --> 00:02:16.484
(bellowing)

00:02:20.071 --> 00:02:21.364
GRANNY: Fire!
开火

00:02:24.033 --> 00:02:25.493
Boo-yah, baby!
来啦 宝贝儿

00:02:25.577 --> 00:02:26.411
(screams)

00:02:26.494 --> 00:02:28.121
-(grunts)
-Huh?

00:02:28.204 --> 00:02:29.038
Ooh!

00:02:29.122 --> 00:02:30.832
This feels so good!
感觉真是好极了

00:02:30.915 --> 00:02:33.042
Ah, thank you, Mr. Whale!
谢谢 鲸鱼先生

00:02:33.501 --> 00:02:34.627
Hi, Manny!
嗨 曼尼

00:02:34.711 --> 00:02:35.795
Sid?!
希德

00:02:35.879 --> 00:02:36.921
ELLIE: Help!
救命

00:02:37.005 --> 00:02:39.215
(rumbling)

00:02:39.883 --> 00:02:40.925
Mom!
妈妈

00:02:42.594 --> 00:02:44.554
No, Peaches! I'll get
your mother. You stay there.
不 桃子 我去救妈妈 你待在那儿

00:02:44.637 --> 00:02:45.472
Hurry, Manny!
快点 曼尼

00:02:46.973 --> 00:02:47.807
(grunts)

00:02:49.392 --> 00:02:51.352
Payback time.
复仇时间到了

00:02:51.436 --> 00:02:53.354
-(gasps)
-Manny!
曼尼

00:02:53.438 --> 00:02:54.272
Ellie!
艾莉

00:02:54.355 --> 00:02:55.356
I got this, Dad.
让我来 爸爸

00:02:55.815 --> 00:02:56.733
Peaches! No!
桃子 不 这太危险了

00:02:56.816 --> 00:02:57.734
It's too dangerous!
桃子 不 这太危险了

00:02:58.651 --> 00:03:00.278
Not if you're half possum!
我可有一半负鼠的血统

00:03:00.361 --> 00:03:01.780
(grunts)

00:03:06.326 --> 00:03:07.202
(growls)

00:03:07.285 --> 00:03:08.661
(yells)

00:03:09.120 --> 00:03:10.622
(grunting)

00:03:15.335 --> 00:03:16.336
Hmm.

00:03:16.419 --> 00:03:17.629
She did it.
她成功了

00:03:18.421 --> 00:03:20.089
My daughter's all grown up.
我的女儿已经长大了

00:03:20.799 --> 00:03:21.633
(straining)

00:03:25.220 --> 00:03:26.304
That's my girl.
做得好 女儿

00:03:26.387 --> 00:03:27.555
(rumbling)
做得好 女儿

00:03:30.099 --> 00:03:31.267
We need to get out of here.
我们快点离开这儿

00:03:31.935 --> 00:03:33.436
Go, go!
I'm right behind you.
快 快 我就在你们后面

00:03:33.520 --> 00:03:36.523
No! I'm right
behind you.
是我在你的后面

00:03:36.606 --> 00:03:37.482
-(both gasp)
-Dad!
爸爸

00:03:37.565 --> 00:03:39.234
(rumbling)
爸爸

00:03:46.282 --> 00:03:47.200
Whoa!

00:03:47.283 --> 00:03:48.201
No!
不

00:03:50.703 --> 00:03:52.455
There's nowhere
to run, Manny!
你无处可逃了 曼尼

00:03:52.539 --> 00:03:53.373
(grunts)
你无处可逃了 曼尼

00:03:54.123 --> 00:03:54.958
(laughs)

00:03:57.043 --> 00:03:58.127
(yells)

00:03:59.921 --> 00:04:01.047
(both grunting)

00:04:04.717 --> 00:04:06.427
You know, this ocean isn't
知道吗 这片海洋可
容不下我们两个人

00:04:06.511 --> 00:04:07.679
big enough
for the both of us.
知道吗 这片海洋可
容不下我们两个人

00:04:09.389 --> 00:04:13.184
Don't worry. You won't take up
much space once I flatten you!
等我踩扁你之后你就不那么占地方了

00:04:13.643 --> 00:04:14.477
(groans)

00:04:17.021 --> 00:04:18.106
(yells)

00:04:21.651 --> 00:04:22.777
(yells)

00:04:22.861 --> 00:04:23.778
(grunts)

00:04:27.282 --> 00:04:28.408
Told ya, tubby.
早告诉过你

00:04:28.741 --> 00:04:31.744
You shouldn't have messed
with the master of the seas.
你不应该惹海洋的霸主

00:04:33.079 --> 00:04:36.749
You know, sometimes,
it pays to weigh 11 tons!
体重十一吨也是有好处的

00:04:36.833 --> 00:04:37.834
No!
不

00:04:37.917 --> 00:04:40.044
Bon voyage, monkey boy!
一路走好 臭猴子

00:04:40.128 --> 00:04:41.296
(screams)
一路走好 臭猴子

00:04:45.300 --> 00:04:47.260
(screaming)

00:04:49.888 --> 00:04:51.556
Did somebody hail a whale?
是有人在招呼鲸鱼吗

00:04:55.643 --> 00:04:58.646
So, you must be Precious.
那么 想必你就是宝宝

00:04:59.814 --> 00:05:01.733
Mission accomplished, Granny.
任务完成 奶奶

00:05:01.816 --> 00:05:05.194
Hah! Who says
old ladies can't drive?
谁说老太婆不会开车

00:05:06.279 --> 00:05:08.072
(groaning)

00:05:10.283 --> 00:05:11.367
Huh?

00:05:12.201 --> 00:05:13.036
(low growl)

00:05:13.119 --> 00:05:14.412
Huh?

00:05:15.496 --> 00:05:19.542
(singsong):
Oh, Captain Gutt.
哦 肚肚船长

00:05:20.335 --> 00:05:22.253
That's me.
正是我

00:05:22.629 --> 00:05:25.298
Let's rule the seas together.
我们一起统治大海吧

00:05:25.381 --> 00:05:26.841
Aye-aye.
遵命

00:05:28.635 --> 00:05:29.594
Huh?

00:05:30.094 --> 00:05:31.596
(screams)

00:05:31.679 --> 00:05:34.140
Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow,
ow, ow, ow, ow, ow!

00:05:41.064 --> 00:05:42.023
Dad!
爸爸

00:05:42.106 --> 00:05:43.650
(cheering)
太帅了

00:05:43.733 --> 00:05:45.485
How's that for an entrance?
这个出场怎么样

00:05:51.157 --> 00:05:52.617
Dad! (chuckles)
爸爸

00:05:52.700 --> 00:05:53.534
(sighs)

00:05:53.618 --> 00:05:54.577
Manny.
曼尼

00:05:55.244 --> 00:05:57.705
(chuckles)

00:05:57.789 --> 00:06:00.500
I told you your father
would never give up on us.
我说过你爸爸绝不会丢下我们

00:06:00.583 --> 00:06:01.417
Never.
绝不

00:06:02.543 --> 00:06:04.337
(screams)

00:06:05.296 --> 00:06:07.173
Hey. I actually...
嘿 我其实也

00:06:07.256 --> 00:06:08.383
(grunts)

00:06:09.425 --> 00:06:10.343
Oh.

00:06:10.802 --> 00:06:12.053
MANNY: You know, Sid,
知道吗 希德

00:06:12.136 --> 00:06:13.554
you're not such a screw-up.
你其实也不是那么没用

00:06:13.638 --> 00:06:14.973
Aw, really?
啊 真的

00:06:15.056 --> 00:06:16.057
Really.
真的

00:06:16.140 --> 00:06:17.308
You're a hero.
你是个英雄

00:06:19.143 --> 00:06:20.436
You, too, Granny.
你也是 奶奶

00:06:20.520 --> 00:06:22.146
Thanks, lady.
(laughs)
谢谢 姑娘

00:06:22.647 --> 00:06:24.899
So, still want me
on your scurvy crew?
还愿意让我加入你的小团体吗

00:06:24.983 --> 00:06:27.360
You bet.
Welcome to our herd.
那当然 欢迎你加入我们

00:06:29.612 --> 00:06:30.655
PEACHES:
Hey, you.
还有你

00:06:31.823 --> 00:06:33.616
I can't believe
you did that for me.
真不敢相信你会为我这么做

00:06:34.617 --> 00:06:35.618
Thank you.
谢谢

00:06:36.077 --> 00:06:38.496
Well, someone once told me,
no matter what,
有人曾经告诉我 无论如何

00:06:38.579 --> 00:06:40.164
you never leave
a friend behind.
都不能丢下你的朋友

00:06:42.125 --> 00:06:44.210
All this sweetness
is gonna rot my teeth.
这么甜蜜会把我的牙都蛀掉的

00:06:44.752 --> 00:06:45.795
If I had any.
如果牙还在的话

00:06:45.878 --> 00:06:47.296
(laughter)

00:06:47.380 --> 00:06:48.715
(rumbling)

00:06:51.300 --> 00:06:52.593
Our home is gone.
我们的家全毁了

00:06:53.261 --> 00:06:54.887
Where do we go now?
以后该去哪儿呢

00:07:05.189 --> 00:07:06.399
(Precious bellowing)

00:07:08.317 --> 00:07:09.736
(laughs)

00:07:09.819 --> 00:07:10.987
Aw.
妈妈也爱你 宝宝

00:07:11.070 --> 00:07:12.905
Mama loves you, too!
妈妈也爱你 宝宝

